oducts_or_unmatched_lots_causally_prove_one_package_format_is_better","compare_delivered_cost_per_week_ten_accepted_serving_after_waste_and_rotation_risk_not_sticker_price_total_mass_or_rating_alone","end_with_a_reversible_week_0_2_6_and_10_trial_and_a_conditional_purchase_or_shorter_horizon_rule"],"scenario":"You live in a rural area, shop only every couple of months, and want a chocolate-and-nut pantry stash that is still genuinely enjoyable in week ten. A previous chocolate batch developed a chalky white coating and an expensive nut snack tasted stale. The frozen shopping set contains five exact offers: an 8-count Hershey snack-size pack described as individually wrapped, a five-pound West End Foods bundle of Ghirardelli 60-percent squares, a 14-ounce resealable Blue Diamond dark-chocolate-flavored almond bag, twelve 4.5-ounce resealable Second Nature dark-chocolate nut-mix pouches, and a selected two-pound Oh Nuts almond bag. Some seller fields conflict: the Hershey page also reports 1.41 ounces in Product Dimensions and the Oh Nuts page also reports 1.2 pounds in Package Dimensions. The background packet discusses chocolate bloom, tempering and cocoa-butter crystals, oxygen-driven autoxidation, moisture- and oxygen-transmission measurements, and sensory discrimination testing. Four community discussions concern pocket melting, opening and clipping snack bags, labeling stored containers, and historical local sourcing. No source supplies an exact lot history, complete package construction, measured barrier result, or matched ten-week trial for these offers.","target":"Explain what the chalky white chocolate coating and stale nut flavor can and cannot mean chemically, audit the five exact offers without promoting seller copy or generic packaging mechanisms into ten-week evidence, and design a practical rural stocking plan. Compare unit independence, opening exposure, exact quantity, lot and date traceability, package state, current delivered cost, waste risk and week-ten acceptability. Specify what must be verified before purchase; a week 0, 2, 6 and 10 protocol using separate sealed units, environment logs, visible-defect classification, safety stops and sensory measures; when blinded discrimination is and is not informative; and a final least-commitment purchase, shorter-horizon or deferral rule. Do not name an unconditional product, brand or package winner."},"graph_motif":"multi_branch_synthesis","graph_node_to_step_id":{"bridge_bloom_temper_crystal_boundary":"B1","bridge_community_operational_scope":"B2","bridge_independent_unit_rotation_cost":"B5","bridge_oxidation_package_measurement_boundary":"B3","bridge_seller_offer_identity_conflict_scope":"B4","bridge_staged_ten_week_sensory_protocol":"B6","bridge_stash_decision_preparation":"B7","decision_evidence_bounded_stash":"D1","prop_autoxidation_food_rancidity_scope":"E1","prop_bag_clip_tip_scope":"E2","prop_block_chocolate_availability_scope":"E3","prop_bloom_mechanism_boundary":"E4","prop_blue_diamond_resealable_scope":"E5","prop_discrimination_testing_scope":"E6","prop_ghirardelli_bulk_scope":"E7","prop_hershey_individual_scope":"E8","prop_label_storage_tip_scope":"E9","prop_mvtr_package_test_scope":"E10","prop_oh_nuts_bulk_scope":"E11","prop_otr_package_test_scope":"E12","prop_pocket_melt_incident_scope":"E13","prop_second_nature_multi_pouch_scope":"E14","prop_tempering_crystal_scope":"E15"},"motif_compilation_schema":"graph_motif_compilation_v1","topology_checks":{"has_multiple_independent_branches":true,"has_synthesized_decision":true}},"directly_scorable_gold":false,"discovery_parameters":{"max_expansion_depth":4,"per_stratum":1,"selection_seed":"dra-v3-strata-v1"},"graph_stamp":"evidence-graph-v1:sha256:50ec4093d173071fdcbd8af2cde63ae2bcc0c686698525a5acf4e2fc58cbb830","schema":"motif_candidate_compilation_bundle_v1"}
